  "description": "Strongly typed C# OpenSTAAD wrapper for Bentley STAAD.Pro automation on Windows .NET 9 (.NET Core). Provides session attachment/acquisition with process and model identity checks, metadata and model/path/process observations, and model/application operations with XML IntelliSense. This preview supplies twenty Root operations and wrapper foundations. Requires installed, licensed STAAD.Pro; other domain adapters are binding-only placeholders.",
