  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported SetSilentMode, SaveModel, OpenSTAADFile, CloseSTAADFile and ShowApplication with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Preserved enum, path and fluent return contracts, explicit native completion/error behavior, and constructing-thread, binding and reentrancy guards. Twenty Root operations are implemented; see the model lifecycle guide for save/open/close readiness and refresh requirements.",
